ined; v2 repaired/accepted.\",\n+      \"First header-probe console Unicode failure after Lean exit0 retained as tooling evidence; v2 actual stable replay0.\",\n+      \"Repeated-hint sharp source completion ordinary rational counterevidence retained; only its invalid cancellation is SOURCE_INVALID, not the virtual-repeat operation.\"\n+    ],\n+    \"salvage\": \"All proposal/failed topology/headers/receipts retained; no fragment or directory discarded.\",\n+    \"purification\": \"pending; never infer PURIFIED from PROVED, PR or merge\",\n+    \"exposition_seal\": \"pending until actual local reader/gates/review\"\n+  },\n+  \"reader_plan\": \"One coherent identity card and adjacent declaration-bound lesson: source anchor, variables/indices, full signed equality, natural-language telescoping proof, exact Lean folded, source-vs-Lean delta, real dependencies, terminal-gap correction and remaining red boundary. Preserve all old parsed Book objects.\",\n+  \"graph_plan\": {\n+    \"Source Proof Graph\": \"Reviewed source-only v2 with original/corrected separate and OPEN analytic obligations.\",\n+    \"Lean Graph\": \"One prospective canonical algebra node; actual TYPE/VALUE occurrence evidence only after compilation, no necessity claim.\",\n+    \"Compressed spine\": \"Single finite cumulative-potential telescope; implementation bookkeeping compressed with full drill-down.\",\n+    \"Overview\": \"Partial chapter remains partial; no whole parent/container completion.\",\n+    \"Functor Hypergraph\": \"none-found-with-reason: this bookkeeping identity alone does not establish a transport or new discovery.\"\n+  },\n+  \"remaining_mandatory\": [\n+    \"Whole corrected7.47 actual hinted producer, proper/finiteness/EReal adapter, zero-hint ghost attainment/support qualification, stability and Young bound.\",\n+    \"Whole corrected15.31 actual minima, support/strong-convexity, final repeated-state convention and interior movement bound.\",\n+    \"B1-B7 and all seven required containers/six future claims remain; no target removed.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"chapter_state\": {\n+    \"required_open_forward_containers\": 7,\n+    \"future_claims_open\": 6,\n+    \"chapter2_status\": \"partial\",\n+    \"chapter2_accepted\": false,\n+    \"mandatory_count\": null,\n+    \"Goal\": \"ACTIVE\"\n+  },\n+  \"governance_RAW_context\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"AGENTS.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"6635867d8d12521d553d503e3c461b30d995f56db06f5acc3eb1745ec8688a93\",\n+      \"bytes\": 10449\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"CONTRIBUTING.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"ea004f626be82fde7e4b5c42dacd112cdba47574333c4b8af1fd2593d45bd11f\",\n+      \"bytes\": 6516\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contributor-codex-contract.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"bf1bea6a7532f1a192f6289107e3120a6428b2806850cfe69bb62c71865a8353\",\n+      \"bytes\": 7546\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/theorem-publication-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"71772f56444ba1e919aab9cc0d8caab3f0fb6b20887a12aa0f73001afd1c4385\",\n+      \"bytes\": 6069\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/proof-digestion-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"8a183dde41c2b58f5c6a6e2fa4158ccc64ad3e427b9349110d15141aed254492\",\n+      \"bytes\": 12607\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"9e529672bb9706b245596e272024d4b38f3e5a32a5b54310ac70aa8d2118ccf7\",\n+      \"bytes\": 7853\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/openai-math-assimilation-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"6ddbcdde41d742ba288734fb07583268db34fb707ae9560c8f67fe30dcedf0e2\",\n+      \"bytes\": 11967\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"research-wiki/openai-math-2026-intake.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"4dc6b9110af86999368e6d8dad5c69c748c27a29f08e036da6bdcd446c14b8d9\",\n+      \"bytes\": 5504\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs/process_memory.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"d85256d30393b733554a040c0f5fb729e70639e6734fc775ef0e920089a0c578\",\n+      \