ewable PR delivery; chapter/global remain OPEN\"\n+  ],\n+  \"authorization\": \"This proposal does not authorize BODY. After independent freeze audit, parent seals/commits exact inputs, captures clean preproof context and obtains independent verification before explicit BODY authorization.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"ec9780c1b2f1f7183250a51fb0e8a73c57d951e7","filename":"research-wiki/contribution-contracts/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011.json","status":"added","additions":191,"deletions":0,"changes":191,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/research-wiki%2Fcontribution-contracts%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/research-wiki%2Fcontribution-contracts%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/research-wiki%2Fcontribution-contracts%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,191 @@\n+{\n+  \"schema_version\": \"3.0\",\n+  \"id\": \"ONLINE-CH2-B4-FINITE-IDENTITY-20261011\",\n+  \"route\": \"online-learning/chapter-2/b4-finite-identity\",\n+  \"frontier_cell\": \"online-ogd\",\n+  \"source_facing\": true,\n+  \"source\": {\n+    \"kind\": \"book\",\n+    \"title\": \"Online Learning: A Modern Introduction Using Convex Optimization\",\n+    \"version\": \"arXiv1912.13213v10 SHA256 cef4edfa97a6e063e53e9c532717c50aa156e5bc782ea49f969b3385011a1b17\",\n+    \"anchor\": \"Finite-real corrected algebra subclause of repair:7.47-terminal near PDF141-142/printed129-130; related repair:15.31-terminal PDF278-279/printed266-267. Not literal full printed endpoints.\",\n+    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1912.13213v10#page=142\"\n+  },\n+  \"target\": \"Exact finite regret equality for arbitrary carrier and real-valued psi/loss, arbitrary x,u,z,T>0; inclusive G, unscored y(T)=z splice, interior drift and signed terminal gap retained. No optimizer, convexity, algorithm or desired inequality premise. Only one finite-real corrected algebra subclause and its two concrete public canaries are locally compiled and independently BODY-reviewed. Read combined gate, final acceptance and reader status from separate actual receipts in this RUN; focused evidence does not replace them. Full EReal adapter, actual optimistic-FTRL/BTRL producer, ghost attainment, support, stability, Young and both corrected whole7.47/15.31 remain OPEN. Seven Chapter2 containers and six future claims remain open; Chapter2 partial,accepted=false,complete proof denominator=null; Chapters1-16 Goal ACTIVE. Unmerged/unpublished; no main/live/PURIFIED/native whole-loop claim.\",\n+  \"affected_files\": [\n+    \"BanditRLProof/OnlineCumulativePotential.lean\",\n+    \"BanditRLProof.lean\",\n+    \"website/content/chapters.json\",\n+    \"website/content/readings.json\",\n+    \"website/content/highlights.json\"\n+  ],\n+  \"declarations\": [\n+    \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotential.finite_regret_identity\"\n+  ],\n+  \"reuse_plan\": {\n+    \"classification\": \"missing\",\n+    \"decision\": \"new_shared\",\n+    \"searched_existing\": [\n+      \"OnlineWeightedPotential weighted_difference_sum_eq: separable scalar weighted telescope, no exact arbitrary-function identity.\",\n+      \"TsallisFTRLRegret cumulativeLoss/cumulativeLoss_succ: generic prefix infrastructure; regret endpoints require finite-action linear/minimizer scope.\",\n+      \"Mathlib finite-sum infrastructure inspected in sealed retrieval/source review.\"\n+    ],\n+    \"reused_declarations\": [\n+      \"Nat.recAux\",\n+      \"Finset.sum_range_succ\",\n+      \"Finset.sum_range_zero\",\n+      \"Nat.sub_add_cancel\"\n+    ],\n+    \"new_shared_declarations\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotential.finite_regret_identity\"\n+    ],\n+    \"known_consumers\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotentialCanary.finite_identity_one_round_positive_gap\",\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotentialCanary.finite_identity_two_round_terminal_splice\"\n+    ],\n+    \"planned_consumers\": [\n+      \"Future finite corrected optimistic-FTRL and BTRL accounting adapters; not implemented.\"\n+    ],\n+    \"no_duplicate_wrapper\": true,\n+    \"decision_reason\": \"One shared arbitrary-function algebra identity, zero new named helpers/definitions. Bounded reuse search and independent BODY review exclude a wrapper-only replacement.\"\n+  },\n+  \"reader_contract\": {\n+    \"source_anchor_visible\": true,\n+    \"natural_language_formula_proof\": true,\n+    \"hidden_assumptions_visible\": true,\n+    \"source_vs_lean_delta_visible\": true,\n+    \"lean_folded\": true,\n+    \"dependencies_visible\": true,\n+    \"remaining_boundary_visible\": true\n+  },\n+  \"semantic_roundtrip\": {\n+    \"required\": true,\n+    \"status\": \"accepted\",\n+    \"formalizer\": \"/root/b4_finite_identity_formalizer\",\n+    \"blind_decoder\": \"/root/b4_finite_identity_blind; runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/neutral-blind/fresh-blind-v1.json SHA256 a76cbbfc57db5d4f9107574d2167435c06ad7bcb980e5a50554a8f8508e551bc\",\n+    \"source_reviewer\": \"/root/adaptive_decoder; runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/source-header-topology/source-header-review-v1.json SHA256 adda7e17c6ebf0ba1b8c24d9cd78e0df763f55000521ec01fb8d94b51229228f\",\n+    \"verdict\": \"accepted-with-explicit-delta\",\n+    \"remaining_semantic_delta\": \"Arbitrary carrier algebra and globally real function interface specialize the finite-value correction. Whole EReal/performance endpoints remain open. T>0 is explicit; source_assumptions=[hT : 0 < T]. No probabilistic/causal/optimizer premise. Both exact-header canaries have separate bounded BODY acceptance; no whole algorithm endpoint is supplied. Evidence scope: accepted-with-explicit-delta for frozen production signature only; runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/source-header-topology/fresh-blind-binding-v1.json SHA256 0e0362c318b73877cb4d7fa1ce5294d33b56baa71d5ff2f73613722d7aa3be6e\"\n+  },\n+  \"graph_contribution\": {\n+    \"lean_graph\": \"new-node\",\n+    \"overview_graph\": \"no-change-with-reason\",\n+    \"functor_hypergraph\": \"none-found-with-reason\",\n+    \"functor_reason\": \"Carrier abstraction is conceptual algebra reuse; no separately formalized categorical or setting transport.\",\n+    \"focus_targets\": [\n+      \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotential.finite_regret_identity\"\n+    ],\n+    \"visual_review\": \"Exact V3 one-card/one-lesson/module-glob append plan independently approved and applied. Actual generated DOM/pixel reader QA and Exposition Seal remain separate requirements; no render acceptance asserted here.\",\n+    \"edge_semantics\": \"formal-solid; overlays-dashed\"\n+  },\n+  \"progress_updates\": {\n+    \"teaching_route\": \"updated: one corrected finite-real identity card, one declaration-bound lesson and one module glob; all pre-existing parsed objects retained.\",\n+    \"banditrlwiki\": \"no-change-with-reason: no new Bandit setting/result.\",\n+    \"results_ledger\": \"updated: production1/canary2 independently reviewed local candidates; whole parent/container remains open. Fresh combined and final acceptance evidence are separate in this RUN.\",\n+    \"roadmap\": \"no-change-with-reason: Chapter2 partial,7+6/B4 open; Goal ACTIVE.\",\n+    \"website_surfaces\": [\n+      \"website/content/chapters.json\",\n+      \"website/content/readings.json\",\n+      \"website/content/highlights.json\"\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"truth_boundary\": \"Only one finite-real corrected algebra subclause and its two concrete public canaries are locally compiled and independently BODY-reviewed. Read combined gate, final acceptance and reader status from separate actual receipts in this RUN; focused evidence does not replace them. Full EReal adapter, actual optimistic-FTRL/BTRL producer, ghost attainment, support, stability, Young and both corrected whole7.47/15.31 remain OPEN. Seven Chapter2 containers and six future claims remain open; Chapter2 partial,accepted=false,complete proof denominator=null; Chapters1-16 Goal ACTIVE. Unmerged/unpublished; no main/live/PURIFIED/native whole-loop claim.\",\n+  \"verification\": {\n+    \"focused_checks\": [\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/production-core/core-report-v2.json SHA256 5c55e8ea41cf2c18af4c47f9929233e7e4afcf903de00f654fd00edec1ab98aa\",\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-production-body/fresh-production-body-review-v1.json SHA256 4b3246ef699eba8c3df7a8063e12342f86211c43b60efd121ce2bccb58c8aac6\",\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/production-core/compiled-constant-occurrences-v3.json SHA256 7fc98eedc77882cc97cc9923f50073b79991b96e547fe1c8d1ec4f4dcd82f6f1\",\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/production-core/native-statement-fence-v1.json SHA256 fbb95c63f220167e999642845485f6e8bd1f446fd85f5d41122983ea4ee6c46d\",\n+      \"Core source hash per independently reviewed evidence 61c811c0b1f941ec22ac41f64e555a0e4d4d8dc32b8145ea53808dbdc0fc17da; source-only draft author did not read BODY; stabilizing parent inspected source BODY and independent reports.\",\n+      \"Selected actual direct VALUE Nat.recAux, Finset.sum_range_succ, Finset.sum_range_zero, Nat.sub_add_cancel; no project-owned direct VALUE parents; occurrence not necessity/transitive graph.\",\n+      \"Tests\\\\OnlineCumulativePotentialCanary.lean SHA256 a3f7a41bf1ddd25a4a623c865c028e029af267132faaeef9c70f9d28e3a30a8f\",\n+      \"runs\\\\online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011\\\\canary-core\\\\canary-core-report-v1.json SHA256 fd2b0d06cdc28dc9c4bd1da9bd72a7112ad7872097a8778a16143ebb9fd8b03f\",\n+      \"runs\\\\online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011\\\\independent-canary-body\\\\fresh-canary-body-review-v